---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Support &mdash; FodyPay"
  description="Get help with FodyPay &mdash; contact us, find answers to common questions, and report issues."
>
  <header class="nav">
    <div class="nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="logo">Fody<span>Pay</span></a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="support-page">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Support</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">We&rsquo;re here to help. Reach us by email and we&rsquo;ll get back to you within one business day.</p>

      <div class="contact-grid">
        <a href="mailto:support@fodypay.com" class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-icon">&#9993;</div>
          <div class="contact-label">General Support</div>
          <div class="contact-value">support@fodypay.com</div>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:security@fodypay.com" class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-icon">&#128274;</div>
          <div class="contact-label">Security &amp; Fraud</div>
          <div class="contact-value">security@fodypay.com</div>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:legal@fodypay.com" class="contact-card">
          <div class="contact-icon">&#128196;</div>
          <div class="contact-label">Legal &amp; Compliance</div>
          <div class="contact-value">legal@fodypay.com</div>
        </a>
      </div>

      <section>
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="faq">
          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>When will FodyPay launch?</h3>
            <p>FodyPay is currently in development. Join the waitlist on our <a href="/">homepage</a> and you&rsquo;ll be among the first to know when we open access.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>What countries will FodyPay support?</h3>
            <p>FodyPay is designed for global use &mdash; we&rsquo;re targeting support for 150+ countries at launch. Specific availability will depend on local regulatory requirements.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>Who issues the FodyPay virtual card?</h3>
            <p>Virtual cards are issued by <strong>Celtic Bank, Member FDIC</strong>, through Stripe&rsquo;s card-issuing program. FodyPay is a technology platform, not a bank.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I request a refund?</h3>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@fodypay.com">support@fodypay.com</a> within 14 days of the transaction in question. Include your account email and a description of the issue. See our <a href="/terms#refunds">Terms of Service</a> for the full refund policy.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I report a security issue or unauthorized transaction?</h3>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:security@fodypay.com">security@fodypay.com</a> immediately. For suspected account compromise, include your account email and a description of the activity. We treat all security reports as high priority.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>How do I close my account or request data deletion?</h3>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:support@fodypay.com">support@fodypay.com</a> with the subject line <em>&ldquo;Account Closure Request&rdquo;</em> or <em>&ldquo;Data Deletion Request&rdquo;</em>. See our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for details on data retention obligations.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="faq-item">
            <h3>I have a legal or compliance question.</h3>
            <p>Email <a href="mailto:legal@fodypay.com">legal@fodypay.com</a>. For law enforcement requests, please include your jurisdiction, the relevant legal authority, and contact information for your agency.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-links">
        <p>Also see: <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="container">
      <p>&copy; 2026 <a href="https://fodylabs.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">FodyLabs</a>. <a href="/">Home</a> &middot; <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> &middot; <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a></p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --orange: #ff8c00;
    --bg: #faf9f7;
    --text: #111827;
    --text-muted: #6b7280;
    --border: #e5e3de;
    --max: 800px;
  }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; }
  .container { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

  .nav { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .nav-inner { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; height: 60px; display: flex; align-items: center; }
  .logo { font-size: 1.2rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text); }
  .logo span { color: var(--orange); }

  .support-page { padding: 60px 0 80px; }
  h1 { font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .subtitle { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }

  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(200px, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .contact-card {
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 24px 20px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--text);
    transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
  }
  .contact-card:hover { border-color: var(--orange); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,140,0,0.1); }
  .contact-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; }
  .contact-label { font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted); }
  .contact-value { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--orange); font-weight: 500; }

  section { margin-bottom: 40px; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 24px; margin-top: 0; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  h3 { font-size: 0.95rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--text); }
  p { font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }
  a { color: var(--orange); text-decoration: underline; }

  .faq { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 28px; }
  .faq-item { border-left: 3px solid var(--border); padding-left: 16px; }
  .faq-item:hover { border-color: var(--orange); }

  .legal-links { text-align: center; }
  .legal-links p { font-size: 0.85rem; }

  .footer { padding: 24px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 20px; }
  .footer p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-align: center; }
  .footer a { color: var(--text-muted); }
</style>
